$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arcosh}⁡u+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have $16{x}^{2}=(4x)^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=4x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=4\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{4}\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and compute it, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{16{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(4x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\,\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{arcosh}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{arcosh}⁡4x+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186167358 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a1c9442d-b554-536e-bccc-2d9480b8f90c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9arcosh (\\frac{x}{2}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165357} {:answer/id #uuid "c08cffcb-7153-5e98-88b0-08aeea905620" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3arcosh (\\frac{x}{2}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165358} {:answer/id #uuid "dedad29a-2114-5062-9ac3-947889055306" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2arcosh (\\frac{x}{3}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165359} {:answer/id #uuid "ec2f73ad-cef2-577b-bb14-1aac8c7f1661" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3arsinh (\\frac{x}{9}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165360} {:answer/id #uuid "5ffd0a33-2cc8-5516-9493-b4ad4d3e4d9d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9arsinh (\\frac{x}{3}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165361}] :answer-field/id #uuid "16b364d1-84f2-59cf-a17f-4ae967