" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}\\operatorname{artanh}⁡(\\frac{x}{7})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186380302} {:answer/id #uuid "d65f18db-acc9-5ff6-a2d8-9d74a3738e71" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{7}{5}\\operatorname{artanh}⁡(\\frac{x}{3})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186380303}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a982c525-5689-5796-b053-a4c8158aa9a0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{7}{5}\\operatorname{artanh}⁡(\\frac{x}{5})+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186380300} :answer-field/id #uuid "4f6e4951-3dda-5413-960d-dd154e204dc6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186380298}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "8245b487-0983-54d2-8577-514866dc50de" :question/math-academy-id "q-95435" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{7}{25-{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "Let's rewrite our integral as\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{7}{25-{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{7}{25}\\int \\frac{1}{1-{(\\frac{x}{5})}^{2}}\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nThis integral resembles the basic integral for the inverse hyperbolic tangent,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1-{u}^{2}}\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{artanh}⁡u+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have ${(\\frac{x}{5})}^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\frac{x}{5}.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{5}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=5\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and compute it, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{7}{25-{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{7}{25}\\int \\frac{1}{1-{(\\frac{x}{5})}^{2}}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{25}\\int \\frac{1}{1-{u}^{2}}\\cdot 5\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{5}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{1-{u}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{5}\\operatorname{artanh}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{5}\\operatorname{artanh}⁡(\\frac{x}{5})+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that this result is subject to the condition $|\\frac{x}{5}|<1.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186167361 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9677e3e0-d763-53d1-8ff2-1174cd80cc06" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}artanh 1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165375} {:answer/id #uuid "abe34537-82cf-5a8e-a2cf-2ba5e373ab07" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}artanh (\\frac{1}{2})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165376} {:answer/id #uuid "b9fe5b69-77e4-5bcf-8461-9ec650010376" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}artanh (\\frac{1}{4})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165377} {:answer/id #uuid "4b2f7cb5-08e8-57fa-961d-d58715ee7bd3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}artanh (\\frac{1}{2})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165378} {:answer/id #uuid "5bebefd6-5dd2-59a1-994d-e7b2be5657ea" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}artanh (\\frac{1}{4})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165379}] :answer-field/id #uuid "b43a012d-119f-57d7-90e2-e3234fd8da05" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165374}] :question/id #uuid "7ab4e43d-e8bc-53e2-aa35-d02f8769d11d" :question/math-academy-id "q-95436" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral\n$\\displaystyle \\int_{0}^{1/4}\\frac{2}{3 - 12x^{2}}dx$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186167364 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cd252c81-105b-5c99-bf9f-a90ccb0e6754" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 